     "heroSection": {
      "id": 57,
      "title": "Hey\nI'm Artem",
      "aboutText": "Director & Creative Lead. Founder of **[ZHEESHEE studio](https://zheeshee.com/)**. I mix live action with CG — building worlds, inventing characters, making things that shouldn't exist look real. Or unreal. As long as you can't stop looking at it",
      "handwrite": {
       "id": 581,
       "text": "hey",
       "color": "#00FE40"
      }
     },
     "aboutSection": {
      "id": 57,
      "title": "I've directed The Spark short, the Pause Fest intro, a Russ snippet, and commercials for Yandex, Winline, and Haval. Cinematics for Dota2, Rush Royale, Iron Harvest, Hero Wars — and moooore",
      "description": "I'm also the founder of Roar Games, where we're building Tenet of the Spark — an action adventure game with world-switching mechanics. And dad to two cool kids who know every single one of these projects and a husband to wonderful girl who gives me the space to keep creating all of this madness",
